Why this licence
----------------

Race action, speed profiles, circuit centrelines, and every `track_s`, distance
and view field computed from a centreline are derivatives of OpenF1, which is
published under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Its ShareAlike term requires derivatives to be
distributed under the same licence. That obligation follows from distribution
itself, not from commercial use. Applying it to the dataset as a whole satisfies
it in one step.

