Additional obligation: OpenStreetMap stand names
------------------------------------------------

Geometry in this dataset contains no OpenStreetMap data. The pipeline does not
call the Overpass API.

What remains is a set of stand NAMES on 89 zones that were originally taken from
OSM `name` tags. Those name fields are © OpenStreetMap contributors and are
additionally subject to ODbL 1.0.

The boundary is self-describing: a record whose `provenance.name` contains
`"osm"` carries that obligation on its name field, and no other field does.
Reuse that does not take those names does not touch ODbL.

These names are not independently verified and some are known to conflict with
official venue-map labels. Replacing them with independently sourced names is a
welcome contribution and will remove this clause.

